<title>JAPAN: Japan end-Nov oil product stocks up 3.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan end-Nov oil product stocks up 3.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Wednesday issued the following data on oil product stockpiles held by refineries, distributors and importers as of end-November.</p>
<p>		(1,000kl)   (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p>Gasoline	1,943	 12,221    + 1.6    - 9.4</p>
<p>Naphtha	 1,735	 10,913    - 7.2    +12.2</p>
<p>Jet Fuel	  791	  4,975    - 6.2    - 6.2</p>
<p>Kerosene	4,876	 30,760    - 1.8    + 5.0</p>
<p>Gas Oil	 2,291	 14,410    - 2.8    +16.1</p>
<p>Fuel Oil A    1,779	 11,190    + 1.4    +10.0</p>
<p>Fuel Oil B	  4	     25    -33.3    -20.0</p>
<p>Fuel Oil C    1,992	 12,530    - 9.7    - 3.7</p>
<p>Total	  15,411	 97,024    - 3.2    + 3.8</p>
<p>--Tokyo Energy Desk (81-3-5473-3708)</p>
</text>
